---
// The Current time: {{now}} incident: a stable prefix is reused across requests; a timestamp early in the system prompt forces everything after it to be recomputed.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 420"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-ti-title d2-ti-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-ti-title">One timestamp line breaks prefix reuse</title>
	<desc id="d2-ti-desc">
		Two requests compared as token sequences. Request A has a stable system prompt: the system prompt, tool
		definitions and history are unchanged from the previous request, so their KV states are reused from the cache and
		only the new message is computed. Request B adds the line Current time: &#123;&#123;now&#125;&#125; near the start of the system
		prompt. The part of the system prompt before it is still reused, but the timestamp differs on every request, so
		it and everything after it must be recomputed every request. Result for a customer service agent handling
		100,000 conversations a day: TTFT rose from 0.5 seconds to 3 to 5 seconds for every conversation, and the
		monthly inference bill nearly doubled.
	</desc>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">One timestamp line breaks prefix reuse</text>

	<text x="6" y="70" font-weight="700">Request A: stable system prompt</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="6" y="84" width="538" height="62" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="22" y="110" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">System prompt, tools, history</text>
		<text x="22" y="132" class="dg-sub">unchanged prefix: reused from the cache</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="552" y="84" width="162" height="62" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="568" y="110" font-weight="700">New message</text>
		<text x="568" y="132" class="dg-sub">computed</text>
	</g>

	<text x="6" y="188" font-weight="700">Request B: timestamp in the system prompt</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="6" y="202" width="152" height="62" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="22" y="228" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">System prompt</text>
		<text x="22" y="250" class="dg-sub">reused</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="166" y="202" width="206" height="62" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="182" y="228" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Current time: &#123;&#123;now&#125;&#125;</text>
		<text x="182" y="250" class="dg-sub">differs every request</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="378" y="202" width="166" height="62" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="394" y="228" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Everything after</text>
		<text x="394" y="250" class="dg-sub">recomputed</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="552" y="202" width="162" height="62" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="568" y="228" font-weight="700">New message</text>
		<text x="568" y="250" class="dg-sub">computed</text>
	</g>
	<text x="166" y="290" class="dg-sub">first differing token: KV states from here on can't be reused</text>

	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="6" y="310" width="708" height="100" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="22" y="338" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">The next day (100,000 conversations a day)</text>
		<text x="22" y="364">TTFT for every conversation: 0.5 s → 3–5 s</text>
		<text x="22" y="390">Monthly inference bill: nearly doubled</text>
	</g>
</svg>
